  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Icod.Terminal 1.8.1 is a maintenance release for the published 1.8 line. It corrects stale post-release documentation, streamlines the repository README and current roadmap, improves the sample catalog, adds focused backend-neutral raster graphics and VS Code OSC 633 shell-integration samples, and builds those samples on net8.0, net9.0, and net10.0 during repository validation. No public API or terminal-runtime protocol behavior change is intended; the 1.7/1.8 public API fingerprint and stable 1.0 compatibility floor remain unchanged. Full notes: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/v1.8.1/docs/releases/1.8.1.md ; compatibility: https://github.com/uniblab/Icod.Terminal/blob/v1.8.1/docs/Compatibility-and-Versioning.md",
